# Keep the build context minimal and secret-free (REL-001). The Python
# image builds install from pyproject/uv.lock + source; none of the
# below is needed at build time, and several must never enter an image.
.git
.github
**/node_modules
**/.venv
.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/dist
**/build
apps/web/test-results
apps/web/playwright-report
apps/web/e2e/__screenshots__
# Secrets / local env — never bake into an image.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
# Local scratch and infra state.
infrastructure/local
prototype
